": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:13:33Z", "username": "Sumit Gupta", "text": "After pouring in billions, they continue to suck", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:13:37Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "DTW the delta terminal is excellent", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:13:38Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "these days, I am surprised when a US airport is good.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:13:40Z", "username": "Dhruv", "text": "whats the best international airport experience you guys have had? for me (have not visited changi) it was a tie between Schiphol and Charles De Gaulle", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:13:48Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "BLR :)", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:13:51Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "What an airport", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:13:54Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "SFO isn’t half bad, and i know my way around it thoroughly", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:14:11Z", "username": "Sumit Gupta", "text": "This is BLR T2, pure aesthetics. None of the US airports can matcgh this ‎image omitted", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:14:25Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "My gf travels a lot and she says Singapore is unparalleled.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:14:25Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Singapore, Hong Kong, Bengaluru", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:14:27Z", "username": "Prathamesh", "text": "My favourite is Harvey Milk Terminal at SFO", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:14:29Z", "username": "Sumit Gupta", "text": "Changi ✈️", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:14:36Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Changi is the benchmark for everyone", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:14:49Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "but BLR new terminal is on par with Changi on facilities", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:15:04Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "where it doesn’t compare is the execution — in Changi your bags are on the belt by the time you get there", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:15:41Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "yeah, most recent upgrade. looking forward to the new T3 coming next year", "role": "confirmation", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:15:50Z", "username": "Prathamesh", "text": "My new favourite is Navi Mumbai International Airport because it is so close to my house in Panvel 😄", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:15:59Z", "username": "Sumit Gupta", "text": "We just need 40 minutes on Changi to catch an international flight, how did they even simplify their operations to this extent", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-30T04:16:00Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "is Navi Mumbai operational?", "role": "c